OL,3,GNEWSAWoman cleared over ex-partner's
OL,4,Afatal crash conspiracy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been cleared of involvement
OL,7,Fin a conspiracy to assault her
OL,8,Fex-partner that resulted in a fatal
OL,9,Fcrash.
OL,11,FSean Burlton, 28, drowned when the car
OL,12,Fhe was a passenger in left the road and
OL,13,Fended up a ditch on Counter Drain Drove
OL,14,Fin Tongue End, near Bourne,
OL,15,FLincolnshire, in November 2023.
OL,17,FBurlton was in a Ford Focus that
OL,18,Fallegedly tried to ram a VW Touran
OL,19,Fbeing driven by his new girlfriend's
OL,20,Fex-partner, Richard McMullon.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
